(7356851, 1151790, 159723, '<td valign="top">This is a very emotional image. I would be curious to see what it would look like in B&amp;W. Perhaps it would make it calmer, perhaps it would not :)</td>', 'This is a very emotional image. I would be curious to see what it would look like in B&W. Perhaps it would make it calmer, perhaps it would not :)', '2015-06-03 09:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356854, 1151342, 180573, '<td valign="top">i really like the soft focus effect</td>', 'i really like the soft focus effect', '2015-06-03 09:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356856, 1151518, 159723, '<td valign="top">Yes! I''m going all Meryl Streep on your entry right now! Hehe... Wonderful shot that probably some will frown upon!</td>', 'Yes! I''m going all Meryl Streep on your entry right now! Hehe... Wonderful shot that probably some will frown upon!', '2015-06-03 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356873, 1151776, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  The only comment I would make (and it''s a pretty small one) is that I''d like to see a little more contrast between your subject and the scene.  She risks getting lost in all the detail but like I said, it''s pretty minor.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  The only comment I would make (and it''s a pretty small one) is that I''d like to see a little more contrast between your subject and the scene.  She risks getting lost in all the detail but like I said, it''s pretty minor.', '2015-06-03 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356876, 1151342, 39679, '<td valign="top">Increasing the color contrast really added to the dreamy effect of this image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Increasing the color contrast really added to the dreamy effect of this image.  Nicely done.', '2015-06-03 10:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356877, 1151236, 35804, '<td valign="top">First vote/photo...I have to stop now and let this one linger.</td>', 'First vote/photo...I have to stop now and let this one linger.', '2015-06-03 10:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356878, 1151812, 177322, '<td valign="top">Simple, uncomplicated BG.  Lovely model. Decidedly serene. Hope this makes the front page.</td>', 'Simple, uncomplicated BG.  Lovely model. Decidedly serene. Hope this makes the front page.', '2015-06-03 10:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356880, 1151026, 39679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but the lack of contrast detracts from it quite a bit.  In my opinion, setting your black level and increasing saturation would have made this shot much more dramatic.</td>', 'I like this shot but the lack of contrast detracts from it quite a bit.  In my opinion, setting your black level and increasing saturation would have made this shot much more dramatic.', '2015-06-03 10:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356888, 1151306, 177322, '<td valign="top">Very unique PoV.</td>', 'Very unique PoV.', '2015-06-03 11:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356889, 1151487, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced composition.</td>', 'Nicely balanced composition.', '2015-06-03 11:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356891, 1151803, 163081, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, looks peaceful. Something wrong with your processing of the sky.<br/>Should finish high. An 8 from me</td>', 'Nice shot, looks peaceful. Something wrong with your processing of the sky.Should finish high. An 8 from me', '2015-06-03 11:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356892, 1151690, 177322, '<td valign="top">The bands of earth-tone colors and varied textures that sweep up to that brooding sky are quite captivating.</td>', 'The bands of earth-tone colors and varied textures that sweep up to that brooding sky are quite captivating.', '2015-06-03 11:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356894, 1151719, 177322, '<td valign="top">Pure sweetness.</td>', 'Pure sweetness.', '2015-06-03 11:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356896, 1150922, 177322, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh - how adorable.  Good work.</td>', 'Oh my gosh - how adorable.  Good work.', '2015-06-03 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356897, 1151814, 177322, '<td valign="top">Delightfully soft foreground focus, yet tack sharp bobber along with a perfectly timed ''click'' to get just the right amount of ripple.  That one red reed echoes the red of the bobber; the yellows of the reed blossom do, too. Perfectly framed.  At first the composition seems chaotic, but the longer one lingers over this image - and I did tarry, it is not; it is mesmerizing.  Brilliant!  Hope to see this on the front page.</td>', 'Delightfully soft foreground focus, yet tack sharp bobber along with a perfectly timed ''click'' to get just the right amount of ripple.  That one red reed echoes the red of the bobber; the yellows of the reed blossom do, too. Perfectly framed.  At first the composition seems chaotic, but the longer one lingers over this image - and I did tarry, it is not; it is mesmerizing.  Brilliant!  Hope to see this on the front page.', '2015-06-03 11:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7356899, 1151786, 177322, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.</td>', 'Very lovely.', '2015-06-03 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
