(7358387, 1151666, 62249, '<td valign="top">The very visible grain works well for this image. The area around the silhouette is perhaps a tad over sharpened. Too much visible halo around the person. But still a good entry for the challenge.</td>', 'The very visible grain works well for this image. The area around the silhouette is perhaps a tad over sharpened. Too much visible halo around the person. But still a good entry for the challenge.', '2015-06-07 23:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358393, 1151340, 62249, '<td valign="top">The contrasty, harsh light is tough to shoot well, but you used it to some advantage here.</td>', 'The contrasty, harsh light is tough to shoot well, but you used it to some advantage here.', '2015-06-07 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358396, 1151607, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and shadows in this image, although  it doesn''t really say "Quiet" to me.</td>', 'I like the texture and shadows in this image, although  it doesn''t really say "Quiet" to me.', '2015-06-07 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358399, 1151804, 62249, '<td valign="top">The individual elements (flowers, sky, etc.) are okay and nicely exposed. There''s just not much going on compositionally. The equipment at the left of the horizon isn''t in focus enough to be the subject, nor do you have a strong foreground element to really tie the composition together.</td>', 'The individual elements (flowers, sky, etc.) are okay and nicely exposed. There''s just not much going on compositionally. The equipment at the left of the horizon isn''t in focus enough to be the subject, nor do you have a strong foreground element to really tie the composition together.', '2015-06-07 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358401, 1151026, 62249, '<td valign="top">Too murky looking. And it almost seems like an outtake from the Leaves challenge. While the shapes of the leaves are interesting, they don''t necessarily seem related to "Quiet."</td>', 'Too murky looking. And it almost seems like an outtake from the Leaves challenge. While the shapes of the leaves are interesting, they don''t necessarily seem related to "Quiet."', '2015-06-08 00:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358403, 1151712, 62249, '<td valign="top">Too much visible banding.</td>', 'Too much visible banding.', '2015-06-08 00:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358406, 1151726, 62249, '<td valign="top">The abstract shapes are somewhat interesting, but the shell seems kind of plopped into place. The shot just looks too staged overall. Maybe a different angle on the shell would help?</td>', 'The abstract shapes are somewhat interesting, but the shell seems kind of plopped into place. The shot just looks too staged overall. Maybe a different angle on the shell would help?', '2015-06-08 00:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
