(7358551, 1151818, 62249, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait that works well in B/W. It doesn''t necessarily say "quiet" to me. But a nicely made image nonetheless.</td>', 'A very nice portrait that works well in B/W. It doesn''t necessarily say "quiet" to me. But a nicely made image nonetheless.', '2015-06-08 02:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
