(7359227, 1151773, 16106, '<td valign="top">Everyone has their own relationship with image grain. In some subjects I like it, but here in one of my favorite images in the challenge, the noise does not help get the quiet across. The subject, framing and tone are top notch, but the grain cuts against the stillness.</td>', 'Everyone has their own relationship with image grain. In some subjects I like it, but here in one of my favorite images in the challenge, the noise does not help get the quiet across. The subject, framing and tone are top notch, but the grain cuts against the stillness.', '2015-06-09 02:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7359228, 1151627, 16106, '<td valign="top">A lovely quiet still image. The very top range of white clouds with the structure all jammed in that last bit of image seems very busy, but the rest of it works well with the gentle back and forth through the frame.</td>', 'A lovely quiet still image. The very top range of white clouds with the structure all jammed in that last bit of image seems very busy, but the rest of it works well with the gentle back and forth through the frame.', '2015-06-09 02:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
