(7360900, 1151731, 9581, '<td valign="top">Well Darn I was trying to go back and edit under  photographers comments here but I guess being a  Registered User there are limits to what I can do..<br/> <br/>Anyways I just wanted to say Thank you to the voters that gave my image a 10,9, and a 8, its a wonderful feeling to know that someone out there may enjoy my image for this I never give up..<br/> I was hoping for a critique here so if anyone wants to give it a go I am all ears..<br/> <br/>I''d really like to hear to why maybe others would give it a 1 or 2... <br/> <br/>I am about to go give out some comments myself because that is why we are here right?<br/></td>', 'Well Darn I was trying to go back and edit under  photographers comments here but I guess being a  Registered User there are limits to what I can do.. Anyways I just wanted to say Thank you to the voters that gave my image a 10,9, and a 8, its a wonderful feeling to know that someone out there may enjoy my image for this I never give up.. I was hoping for a critique here so if anyone wants to give it a go I am all ears.. I''d really like to hear to why maybe others would give it a 1 or 2...  I am about to go give out some comments myself because that is why we are here right?', '2015-06-11 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
